+A visit's scientific fields include observation date, observer list, species cover estimates, and notes. Some edits are unrelated, such as correcting an observer name and adding a missing species. Other edits are related, such as revising a species identification and its cover estimate. The server cannot infer all such relationships from field names, so it never combines fields from different submissions. Every stored state of a visit is a complete visit that one person submitted as a unit.
 
